{"metadata":{"title":[{"Plain":"“块 (范畴 O)”"},2],"ext":[{"Plain":"md"},1],"slug":[{"Plain":"块(范畴O)"},0],"taxon":[{"Plain":"百科. "},3],"author":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},4]},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<p>设 $\\mathfrak g$ 为 Lie 代数, 记 $Z(\\mathfrak g)$ 为 $\\mathcal U\\mathfrak g$ 的中心. 称代数同态 $Z(\\mathfrak g)\\to\\mathbb{C}$ (即 $\\operatorname{Spec}Z(\\mathfrak g)$ 的点) 为中心特征.</p>\n<p>"},{"Local":{"url":"范畴O","text":"范畴 O"}},{"Plain":" 分裂为 $\\operatorname{Spec}Z(\\mathfrak g)$ 参数化的一族子范畴的直和.</p>\n<p>由 "},{"Local":{"url":"Harish-Chandra同构","text":"Harish-Chandra 同构"}},{"Plain":" $Z(\\mathfrak g)\\simeq \\operatorname{Sym}(\\mathfrak h)^{W.}$,</p>\n<p>记 $\\mathfrak h//W =\\operatorname{Spec}(\\operatorname{Sym}(\\mathfrak h)^{W.})$, $\\varpi \\colon \\mathfrak h \\to\\mathfrak h//W$ 为投影.</p>\n"}]}}